1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:02,790
Try to picture it in your mind.

2
00:00:02,790 --> 00:00:04,300
Imagine the person you love.

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,800
Huh?

4
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:09,840
If I were a woman,

5
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:11,470
I would love you with all my heart,

6
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:13,720
and fall helplessly in love with you.

7
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:18,060
Haru.

8
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:19,520
It's your line next.

9
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:21,150
Oh.

10
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:26,690
Any luck?

11
00:00:27,110 --> 00:00:29,650
No change...

12
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:35,080
Oh!

13
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:36,950
Just as I thought.

14
00:00:36,950 --> 00:00:38,370
The last train is gone.

15
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:39,870
Yeah.

16
00:00:40,670 --> 00:00:42,420
Alright, let's walk.

17
00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:44,380
Okay!

18
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:51,220
Ah, we missed it.

19
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:55,930
Oh.

20
00:00:57,020 --> 00:00:58,640
Your acting

21
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:00,480
has improved a lot.

22
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:01,810
Thank you.

23
00:01:01,810 --> 00:01:04,480
It's all thanks to your advice.

24
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:05,980
You were thinking of your mother, right?

25
00:01:05,980 --> 00:01:06,980
Huh?

26
00:01:07,690 --> 00:01:09,820
Thinking of someone you love...

27
00:01:09,820 --> 00:01:11,030
That's how you delivered such a great performance, right?

28
00:01:14,160 --> 00:01:15,950
Minato?
